WEBVTT

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:32.056
Let me just say, quite seriously,

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:33.720
I believe in you.

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:36.760
And despite everything,

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:41.560
I still believe in America.

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:47.296
I hope that this offering
that I've given to you tonight,

00:19:47.320 --> 00:19:49.856
that I've shared with you tonight,

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:53.656
will provide redemptive pathways

00:19:53.680 --> 00:19:58.256
so that you might claim
the fullest of your identity

00:19:58.280 --> 00:20:01.096
and become a major participant